{"id":"amarelo","lemma":"amarelo","pos":"adj","rank":2331,"glosses":["yellow in colour","Oriental (of East Asian descent)","wry; forced; unnatural"],"ipa":"/a.maˈɾɛ.lu/","forms":{"feminine":"amarela","masculinePlural":"amarelos","femininePlural":"amarelas","superlative":"o mais amarelo"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-amarelo.wav","examples":[{"text":"A porta do escritório é amarela.","en":"The door of the office is yellow.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"office"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Quantas flores amarelas há?","en":"How many yellow flowers are there?","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"quanto"},{"g":"flower","l":"flor"},null,{"g":"there be","l":"haver"}]},{"text":"Ele mora na casa amarela.","en":"He lives in the yellow house.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to live, reside","l":"morar"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"house, home"},null]},{"text":"Vermelho, amarelo e azul são cores.","en":"Red, yellow and blue are colors.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/840412","words":[{"g":"red"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"blue"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"colour , color","l":"cor"}]},{"text":"As flores são amarelas.","en":"The flowers are yellow.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"flower","l":"flor"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}